      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LONG GULLY BETH (7) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (23.02) from Box 2 at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. One of the leading chances. ADHANA PHILLIP (1) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 7 lengths away in third (23.24) at this track in a Grade 6 over 400m. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Hard to beat again. VISTA CADMIUM (5) had been in super honest form hitting the frame six times on end before finishing fourth (23.38) at this track last time. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Key runner on best form. TREMOR (8) is worth consideration.",
